C. bits 6 and 5 of 0xF8E, breakpoint disabled, then resume:
   bit 5 set: 0xF8E reads A0, resumed from 0001: CAME BACK BY ITSELF, PC=0002, counters [0, 0, 0, 0], 0xF8E=A0
   bit 6 set: 0xF8E reads C0, resumed from 0002: ran until halted, PC=0021, counters [134, 133, 133, 133], 0xF8E=C0
